            <ArticleTitle>Technique for CT Fluoroscopy-Guided Lumbar Medial Branch Blocks and Radiofrequency Ablation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>631-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
